letter on: firm template: client report
heading: European patent application EP23812345.6: intention to grant
paragraph: The EPO informed us on 30 October 2025 that it intends to grant a European patent (Rule 71(3) EPC).
paragraph: The time limit to approve the text and pay the fees is 2 March 2026, as the firm record computes it. Please instruct us by then.
